  "description": "Editor-only converter from Spine 3.8 JSON exports (skeleton, atlas, pages) to native Unity 2D Animation prefabs: bone hierarchy, sprites, weighted meshes bound with SpriteSkin and one AnimationClip per Spine animation. No Spine runtime code is used or required.",
